NTIC. *PydanticAI: Durable Execution with Temporal & Restate*. Disponível em: https://pydantic.dev. Acesso em: 28 nov. 2025.\n- SMITH, J. et al. *Recursive Agent Harnesses and Capabilities Containment in Sandbox Environments*. Disponível em: https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.13643. Acesso em: 28 nov. 2025.\n- WANG, David et al. *Natural-Language Agent Harnesses (NLAHs) and the Intelligent Harness Runtime*. Disponível em: https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.25723. Acesso em: 28 nov. 2025.\n- ZHANG, L. et al. *Static detection of Infinite Agentic Loops (IALs) via ALDG analysis*. Disponível em: https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.14271. Acesso em: 28 nov. 2025.", "urls": ["https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.25723.", "https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.14271.", "https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.18747.", "https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.13643.", "https://pydantic.dev.", "https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/effective-harnesses-for-long-running-agents.", "https://www.anthropic.com/research/trustworthy-agents-in-practice.", "https://www.langchain.com/langgraph.", "https://www.swebench.com."], "id": "B0006", "tokens": {"fontes": 1, "brutas": 1, "auditor": 1, "rastreabilidade": 1, "anthropic": 2, "effective": 1, "harnesses": 3, "for": 3, "long-running": 1, "agents": 2, "disponivel": 9, "https": 9, "www.anthropic.com": 2, "engineering": 1, "effective-harnesses-for-long-running-agents": 1, "acesso": 9, "nov": 9, "2025": 9, "trustworthy": 1, "practice": 1, "governing": 1, "autonomous": 1, "execution": 3, "research": 1, "trustworthy-agents-in-practice": 1, "chen": 1, "kevin": 1, "al": 4, "code": 1, "agent": 3, "harness": 2, "redefining": 1, "substrate": 1, "long-horizon": 1, "arxiv.org": 4, "abs": 4, "2605.18747": 1, "langgraph": 3, "checkpointers": 1, "stateful": 1, "orchestration": 1, "multi-turn": 1, "workflows": 1, "www.langchain.com": 1, "princeton": 1, "university": 1, "swe-bench": 1, "verified": 1, "pro": 1, "www.swebench.com": 1, "pydantic": 1, "pydanticai": 1, "durable": 1, "with": 1, "temporal": 1, "restate": 1, "pydan